          {"id":"tcs_apt_e2","year":"TCS NQT 2024","q":"P can do a work in 12 days and Q in 18 days. How many days to complete together?","opts":["6","7.2","8","7.5"],"ans":1,"exp":"Combined rate=1/12+1/18=5/36. Days=36/5=7.2 days."},
          {"id":"tcs_apt_e3","year":"TCS NQT 2023","q":"A sum of money doubles itself at 10% simple interest per annum. How many years?","opts":["8","10","12","5"],"ans":1,"exp":"SI=P×R×T/100. For double: P=P×10×T/100. T=10 years."},
          {"id":"tcs_apt_e4","year":"TCS NQT 2023","q":"If 8 workers complete a job in 12 days, how many days for 12 workers?","opts":["6","8","10","16"],"ans":1,"exp":"Work=8×12=96 worker-days. Days=96÷12=8 days."},
          {"id":"tcs_apt_e5","year":"TCS NQT 2022","q":"A boat goes 10 km upstream in 2 hours and downstream in 1 hour. Speed of stream?","opts":["2.5","3","5","4"],"ans":0,"exp":"Upstream speed=5, downstream=10. Stream=(10-5)/2=2.5 km/hr."},
          {"id":"tcs_apt_e6","year":"TCS NQT 2022","q":"Find the missing number: 2, 6, 12, 20, 30, ?","opts":["40","42","44","48"],"ans":1,"exp":"Differences: 4,6,8,10,12. Next=30+12=42."},
          {"id":"tcs_apt_e7","year":"TCS NQT 2021","q":"A person walks at 5 km/hr and reaches 6 mins late. If 6 km/hr, 15 mins early. Distance?","opts":["3.5","4.5","6","7.5"],"ans":2,"exp":"Let distance=d. d/5 - d/6 = 21/60. d=6 km."},
          {"id":"tcs_apt_e8","year":"TCS Digital 2024","q":"Three numbers are in ratio 2:3:5. Sum of squares is 608. Largest number?","opts":["16","20","24","40"],"ans":1,"exp":"Let 2x,3x,5x. 4x²+9x²+25x²=608. 38x²=608. x²=16. x=4. Largest=5×4=20."}
