          {"id":"tcs_apt_m2","year":"TCS NQT 2023","q":"Pipes A and B fill tank in 20 and 30 min. C empties in 15 min. All open: time to fill?","opts":["60","80","120","Cannot be filled"],"ans":2,"exp":"Net rate=1/20+1/30-1/15=1/60. Wait: 3/60+2/60-4/60=1/60. Time=60 min. Actually recompute: 3+2-4=1/60, time=60 min."},
          {"id":"tcs_apt_m3","year":"TCS NQT 2024","q":"In how many ways can the letters of 'ORANGE' be arranged so vowels are together?","opts":["144","160","168","None"],"ans":0,"exp":"Vowels OAE (3) treated as 1 block. 4 items (block+3 consonants)=4!=24. Vowels arrange=3!=6. Total=24×6=144."}
