          {"id":"amz_oop_m2","year":"Amazon SDE-1 2023","q":"Which pattern: defines skeleton of algorithm, subclasses override specific steps?","opts":["Strategy","Template Method","Observer","Decorator"],"ans":1,"exp":"Template Method: parent class defines algorithm skeleton with abstract steps. Subclasses fill in the steps without changing structure. Different from Strategy where entire algorithm is swappable."}
