          {"id":"amz_sd_m2","year":"Amazon Intern 2023","q":"Since Dec 2020, what consistency model does Amazon S3 provide?","opts":["Eventual consistency","Strong read-after-write for all operations","Weak consistency","No guarantees"],"ans":1,"exp":"Since December 2020, S3 provides strong read-after-write consistency for ALL operations (GETs, PUTs, LISTs). Previously eventual consistency. Amazon tests this in system design to check if candidates are current."}
